        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A baby’s laugh lulls an old man to a peaceful death, the snows of winter fall all around the northern realms, and a faithful ally is flayed alive. A king considers two mystical royal bloodline options with the game of thrones board game before him. ",
          "formatting": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "start": 37,
              "end": 51,
              "url": "http://www.getty.edu/art/collection/objects/3925/master-of-james-iv-of-scotland-deathbed-scene-flemish-about-1510-1520/?dz=0.6473,0.4702,1.62"
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "start": 57,
              "end": 77,
              "url": "https://www.google.com/culturalinstitute/asset-viewer/hunters-in-the-snow-winter/WgFmzFNNN74nUg"
