            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A wolf aids a weary fighter, slaves compete like gladiators, and an irate son makes demands of his mother. A seductively venomous prison scene ends with a fortuitous antidote to a powerful poison, while elsewhere, even queens are not free from the iron bars of prison and the judgment of the gods.",
